        "title": "One of the great Hindu Temples",
        "text": "I have been to Pashupatinath Temple twice in my recent visits to Nepal, but unfortunately I have not been able to actually offer my prayers to Lord Shiva as the main temple was closed on both occasions. It is one of the few major Hindu Shrine Temples where non-Hindus are not allowed. The 1100 shiva lingas are a major attraction and you get peach doing puja to Hanumanji. I'd like to go again at Lord Pashupatinath Temple. A Must visit for all Nepal visitors.",
